I have tried doing Astral without conflict to take advantage of my pet
Angel, but I inevitably give in and put it back on. It's been very
effective in my experience, especially in letting other monsters beat
on the Riders so that they're sometimes dead or mostly-dead by the
time I reach them.

In fact the only part of the endgame where I prefer to *not* use
conflict is the Plane of Fire, where I get really tired of all the
messages "The fire elemental attacks the fire giant! The fire giant is
on fire! The fire giant doesn't seem to mind!" etc. Even there I would
put the ring right back on if an Archon appeared and started summoning
though.

